{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2763 Story \u2763</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokyo remains peaceful. No kaiju attacks, no alien invasions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought your life would go on unchanged\u2014ordinary, yet steady.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just because it\u2019s close to school, the two sisters suddenly moved into my house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But each of them carries her own hidden feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ahh\u2026 my daily life is already in chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so begins a cohabitation filled with both nostalgia and noise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2763 Features \u2763</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a slice-of-life cohabitation simulation with your sisters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Live2D touch features and animated cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by four talented CVs: Kaede Akino, Popura Sawano, Shiki Asagi, and Suika Suika</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 8000 fully voiced lines, delivering a rich and lengthy story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 7 high-resolution 4K CGs.Each CG features expression variations and over 200+ character variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and lighthearted mini-games to enjoy on the side</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/extras/7917af4ff633a71ce11dbe918ea8fb46.poster.avif?t=1772093360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/extras/7917af4ff633a71ce11dbe918ea8fb46.webm?t=1772093360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2763 Characters \u2763</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/extras/3ddb16a6275559585e39244cfff75aa8.avif?t=1772093360\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Mikaru Enomoto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV\uff1aPopura Sawano</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height: 156cm\u3000Birthday: March 12\u3000Blood Type: AB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist\u2019s cousin, a freshman university student. She moved in because the house is close to campus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energetic yet sometimes clumsy. Her special skill is being immune to Michiru\u2019s sharp tongue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/extras/2805c4cfd19c975dc84c221770167cac.avif?t=1772093360\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Michiru Hagiwara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Kaede Akino</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height: 152cm\u3000Birthday: December 24\u3000Blood Type: O</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist\u2019s younger sister, an honor student at Hokuka Girls\u2019 Academy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She moved in with her brother because it\u2019s close to school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introverted and poor at expressing emotions, yet sharp-tongued is her specialty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/extras/b97d2eb5b54ac34befae5127c6e2f600.avif?t=1772093360\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Ryoko Ando</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Suika Suika</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height: 162cm\u3000Birthday: August 12\u3000Blood Type: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A junior from the protagonist\u2019s university, who became tied to him through a certain event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduation, she joined the same company where he works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always acting like the \u201cjunior,\u201d she\u2019s proactive but can\u2019t take the decisive step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her specialty is causing trouble for the protagonist, and she hates overtime the most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/extras/384db12349ec9b9554297d458e48f0bf.avif?t=1772093360\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Yoko Ando</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CV: Shiki Asagi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height: 150cm\u3000Birthday: October 15\u3000Blood Type: A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ryoko\u2019s younger sister and Michiru\u2019s classmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright and energetic girl, though sometimes just as careless as her older sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her biggest concern is that her height hasn\u2019t grown at all since her first year of junior high.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991720?t=1772093360","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991720?t=1772093360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/8aa1782618fb4b5ff5763f061a9c93ad3a77a4ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772093360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991720/8aa1782618fb4b5ff5763f061a9c93ad3a77a4ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772093360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2